## NETworkManager
## Build results, IDE / user-specific files and local tool files.
## Website-specific entries (node_modules, build, .docusaurus) are in Website/.gitignore.

# Build results (.NET SDK and WiX projects build to bin/ and obj/)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
artifacts/
publish/
Build/

# Build and test logs
*.binlog
*.log
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# JetBrains Rider / ReSharper
.idea/
*.sln.iml
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/

# NuGet (packages are restored, local packages e.g. from Chocolatey/ are not versioned)
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/

# Code signing certificates
*.pfx

# Binaries (dependencies are restored via NuGet, releases are built by AppVeyor)
*.exe
*.dll

# Operating system files
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Node.js (see also Website/.gitignore)
node_modules/

# Local notes
ToDo.md

# Claude Code: only the shared skills are versioned (local settings, reviews and runtime files are ignored)
**/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
